    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Berkeley & Associates are delighted to present 44 Glenpark Road to the market. This fantastic three-bedroom semi-detached home is ideally located at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac and features a spacious kitchen extension, along with an impressive rear garden offering excellent side access and superb potential to further extend, subject to the necessary planning permission.\r\nThis exceptional property has been meticulously maintained by its current owners and is presented in excellent condition throughout.\r\nNo. 44 is flooded with natural light, creating a bright and welcoming atmosphere. The accommodation briefly comprises an inviting entrance hall, a generous living room to the front of the property, and double doors leading into a spacious family/TV room. This flows seamlessly into the large kitchen and dining area to the rear, with a side door providing access to the impressive rear garden. The garden also benefits from a spacious block-built shed, offering excellent storage or workshop potential.\r\nUpstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms and a modern family bathroom. To the front of the property, a private driveway provides convenient off-street parking.\r\nPalmerstown is a highly regarded suburb renowned for its strong sense of community and excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre. The area is exceptionally well served by a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, and supermarkets, while nearby Liffey Valley Shopping Centre offers an extensive selection of retail, dining, and entertainment options.\r\nThere are a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools in the vicinity, making this an ideal location for families. Outdoor enthusiasts will appreciate the abundance of nearby green spaces, with Phoenix Park—one of Europe's largest enclosed public parks—just a short drive away, offering endless opportunities for recreation and leisure.\r\nPalmerstown also benefits from excellent transport links, with frequent bus services providing easy access to Dublin City Centre. The nearby N4 and M50 road networks ensure convenient travel throughout Dublin and beyond, including Dublin Airport.\r\nContact Berkeley & Associates today as early viewing is highly recommended to full appreciate all it has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\nEntrance Hall – 1.82m x 3.50m\r\nWooden flooring.\r\n\r\nFamily Room – 3.23m x 4.23m\r\nFine size room with wooden flooring, feature fire place and a large window to the front providing gorgeous sunlight. \r\n\r\nLiving Room – 5.15m x 4.24m\r\nLivingroom with timber flooring with access through french double doors to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining – 4.12m x 5.23m\r\nSpacious Kitchen with timber kitchen units tiled splash back, black timber counter top, oven, hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, washing machine, with a feature velux window providing gorgeous natural light and fully tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 – 3.08m x 3.72m\r\nLarge Double Bedroom, spacious window with plenty of sunshine flowing through, timber flooring and fully fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – 3.08m x 3.36m\r\nDouble Bedroom, timber flooring, large window looking out over the rear garden and fully fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 – 2.43m x 2.59m \r\nSpacious bedroom, timber flooring, window and fully fitted wardrobes.\r\nMain Bathroom – 1.96m x 2.39m\r\nModern bathroom with walk in shower, w.c, w.h.b, spacious window and full tiled throughout.\r\n\r\nStairs/Landing – 1.97m x 2.66m\r\nFully fitted carpets and spacious window on the right at the top of the stairs.\r\nMeasurements are only given as a guidance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features\r\n3 Bed Semi Detached\r\nDouble Glazed Windows\r\nGas fire central heating\r\nKitchen Extension\r\nLocated in Cul de Sac\r\nPotential to extended subject to PP.\r\nMature and highly sought-after development\r\nWalking distance to Super Value Palmerstown\r\nLarge block built shed\r\nM50 & N4 Minutes away."
      },
